# Migrated from the retired `game-sequence-v1` file of the same name.
# The lines are the authored ones, copied rather than rewritten.

label elowen_notices_wayfarer:
    stage sunpetal_crossing
    show elowen_thistledew concerned at center
    elowen_thistledew "Before you take the east road, may I see your sleeve? That silver dust is story-pollen. The missing pages have already brushed past you."
    jump wayfarer_asks_about_pollen

label wayfarer_asks_about_pollen:
    show wayfarer curious at center
    wayfarer "Can a page leave pollen? I thought the chronicle was ink and paper, not a garden."
    jump elowen_explains_skybells

label elowen_explains_skybells:
    elowen_thistledew thoughtful "Stories root wherever people repeat them. Skybells once grew along every remembered path in my childhood valley; when the valley was forgotten, the flowers vanished with it."
    jump wayfarer_hears_the_loss

label wayfarer_hears_the_loss:
    wayfarer concerned "So recovering the pages might restore more than the road. It might return things people have stopped knowing how to miss."
    jump elowen_shows_sprig

label elowen_shows_sprig:
    elowen_thistledew delighted "Exactly. This one fresh sprig appeared at dawn beside the road marker. A small proof that memory can grow back before anyone is ready to believe it."
    jump wayfarer_promises_to_notice

label wayfarer_promises_to_notice:
    wayfarer determined "Then I will bring back the pages, but I will also watch what changes around them. Tiny signs deserve witnesses too."
    jump elowen_gives_counsel

label elowen_gives_counsel:
    elowen_thistledew neutral "Keep that instinct. When Crowncrag Road rearranges itself, trust the living details: bent grass, startled birds, and flowers facing light no map remembers."
    jump wayfarer_thanks_elowen

label wayfarer_thanks_elowen:
    wayfarer delighted "A path read like a garden. That is the first lesson today I am certain I will remember."
    jump skybell_memory_shared

label skybell_memory_shared:
    end skybell_memory_shared
